<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>投资纪律 on 📖 爱分享读书</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/tags/%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E7%BA%AA%E5%BE%8B/</link><description>Recent content in 投资纪律 on 📖 爱分享读书</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 08:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.ishareread.com/tags/%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E7%BA%AA%E5%BE%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>黄金冲破4200美元那天，朋友圈又炸了：翻开《赢得输家的游戏》才懂，所有人都在追涨的时候，真正的赢家早就布好了局</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%86%B2%E7%A0%B44200%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%9C%8B%E5%8F%8B%E5%9C%88%E5%8F%88%E7%82%B8%E4%BA%86%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E8%B5%A2%E5%BE%97%E8%BE%93%E5%AE%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E6%89%8D%E6%87%82%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%BD%E6%B6%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%A2%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%A9%E5%B0%B1%E5%B8%83%E5%A5%BD%E4%BA%86%E5%B1%80/</link><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 08:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%86%B2%E7%A0%B44200%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%9C%8B%E5%8F%8B%E5%9C%88%E5%8F%88%E7%82%B8%E4%BA%86%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E8%B5%A2%E5%BE%97%E8%BE%93%E5%AE%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E6%89%8D%E6%87%82%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%BD%E6%B6%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%A2%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%A9%E5%B0%B1%E5%B8%83%E5%A5%BD%E4%BA%86%E5%B1%80/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 黄金冲破4200美元那天，朋友圈又炸了：翻开《赢得输家的游戏》才懂，所有人都在追涨的时候，真正的赢家早就布好了局" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;昨天下午三点多，我正对着电脑改方案，手机突然震个不停。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;打开微信一看，三个群同时在聊同一件事——黄金涨了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;金价破4200了！&amp;ldquo;&amp;ldquo;要不要追？&amp;ldquo;&amp;ldquo;我同事昨天刚买了100克金条&amp;quot;&amp;ldquo;现在上车还来得及吗？&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>今晚油价暴涨680元、加满一箱多花27块：翻开《漫步华尔街》才懂，越是在价格飞涨的时候，普通人越需要学会「不跟市场较劲」的投资纪律</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E4%BB%8A%E6%99%9A%E6%B2%B9%E4%BB%B7%E6%9A%B4%E6%B6%A8680%E5%85%83%E5%8A%A0%E6%BB%A1%E4%B8%80%E7%AE%B1%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%B127%E5%9D%97%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A5%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E8%A1%97%E6%89%8D%E6%87%82%E8%B6%8A%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B7%E6%A0%BC%E9%A3%9E%E6%B6%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%B6%8A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%B7%9F%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E8%BE%83%E5%8A%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E7%BA%AA%E5%BE%8B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E4%BB%8A%E6%99%9A%E6%B2%B9%E4%BB%B7%E6%9A%B4%E6%B6%A8680%E5%85%83%E5%8A%A0%E6%BB%A1%E4%B8%80%E7%AE%B1%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%B127%E5%9D%97%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A5%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E8%A1%97%E6%89%8D%E6%87%82%E8%B6%8A%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B7%E6%A0%BC%E9%A3%9E%E6%B6%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%B6%8A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%B7%9F%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E8%BE%83%E5%8A%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E7%BA%AA%E5%BE%8B/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 今晚油价暴涨680元、加满一箱多花27块：翻开《漫步华尔街》才懂，越是在价格飞涨的时候，普通人越需要学会「不跟市场较劲」的投资纪律" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;昨晚跟朋友吃饭，他说了一句话让我笑了半天：&amp;ldquo;油价涨得比我工资快多了。&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我放下筷子打开手机看了一眼——7月31日24时，国内成品油年内第十次上调，汽柴油每吨上调680元，92号汽油每升涨0.53元，加满一箱50升多花27块。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>